   3:Core/Src/startup.c **** /*
   4:Core/Src/startup.c **** This code will take stuff in .data and .bss in flash memory and load it into RAM.
   5:Core/Src/startup.c **** This is stuff that needs to be stored in non-volatile memory so that its durable so it will be in f
   6:Core/Src/startup.c **** but to be used by MCU when chip is booted it needs to be in RAM.
   7:Core/Src/startup.c **** */
